{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TmJw2nXmNCKxsPjq5scQJ6","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"exp-014: Naturalistic Common Crawl Validation\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"对 Common Crawl 2025/2026 snapshot 样本做 depth 预测，与 AlignScore 和独立 vocabulary richness 指标做 correlation。验证 lab 条件下训练的 depth estimator 在 wild 数据上的可迁移性。\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"depth_pred_distribution\": {\n7\t        \"pred_depth_0_pct\": 0.42,\n8\t        \"pred_depth_1_pct\": 0.31,\n9\t        \"pred_depth_2_pct\": 0.18,\n10\t        \"pred_depth_3plus_pct\": 0.09\n11\t      },\n12\t      \"spearman_rho_depth_vs_alignscore\": -0.08,\n13\t      \"spearman_rho_depth_vs_alignscore_p\": 0.07,\n14\t      \"spearman_rho_depth_vs_vocab_richness\": -0.14,\n15\t      \"spearman_rho_depth_vs_vocab_richness_p\": 0.002,\n16\t      \"spearman_rho_depth_vs_perplexity\": 0.05,\n17\t      \"spearman_rho_depth_vs_perplexity_p\": 0.28,\n18\t      \"calibration_ece\": 0.31,\n19\t      \"pred_confidence_mean\": 0.38,\n20\t      \"pred_confidence_std\": 0.12,\n21\t      \"domain_shift_auc_drop_vs_lab\": 0.15,\n22\t      \"n_samples\": 10000,\n23\t      \"cc_snapshot\": \"2025-51\"\n24\t    },\n25\t    \"tables\": [\n26\t      {\n27\t        \"name\": \"Table: CC 2025 Depth Prediction vs Quality Metrics\",\n28\t        \"columns\": [\n29\t          \"Metric Pair\",\n30\t          \"Spearman ρ\",\n31\t          \"p-value\",\n32\t          \"95% CI\"\n33\t        ],\n34\t        \"rows\": [\n35\t          [\n36\t            \"Pred Depth × AlignScore\",\n37\t            \"-0.08\",\n38\t            \"0.07\",\n39\t            \"[-0.16, 0.01]\"\n40\t          ],\n41\t          [\n42\t            \"Pred Depth × Vocab Richness (TTR)\",\n43\t            \"-0.14\",\n44\t            \"0.002\",\n45\t            \"[-0.22, -0.05]\"\n46\t          ],\n47\t          [\n48\t            \"Pred Depth × Perplexity (GPT-2)\",\n49\t            \"0.05\",\n50\t            \"0.28\",\n51\t            \"[-0.04, 0.13]\"\n52\t          ],\n53\t          [\n54\t            \"Pred Depth × Doc Length\",\n55\t            \"0.03\",\n56\t            \"0.51\",\n57\t            \"[-0.06, 0.11]\"\n58\t          ]\n59\t        ]\n60\t      },\n61\t      {\n62\t        \"name\": \"Table: Predicted Depth Distribution on CC vs Lab\",\n63\t        \"columns\": [\n64\t          \"Depth\",\n65\t          \"CC 2025 (%)\",\n66\t          \"Lab C4 (%)\"\n67\t        ],\n68\t        \"rows\": [\n69\t          [\n70\t            \"0 (human)\",\n71\t            \"42%\",\n72\t            \"16.7%\"\n73\t          ],\n74\t          [\n75\t            \"1\",\n76\t            \"31%\",\n77\t            \"16.7%\"\n78\t          ],\n79\t          [\n80\t            \"2\",\n81\t            \"18%\",\n82\t            \"16.7%\"\n83\t          ],\n84\t          [\n85\t            \"3+\",\n86\t            \"9%\",\n87\t            \"50.0%\"\n88\t          ]\n89\t        ]\n90\t      }\n91\t    ],\n92\t    \"figures\": [],\n93\t    \"analysis\": \"此实验在 worst 档下是 net negative。审稿人将用它构建两条攻击线：(1) \\\"the depth estimator doesn't generalize beyond the controlled lab setting — the features are overfit to the specific generation pipeline\\\" (2) \\\"even weak correlation with quality metrics is absent — K* boundary has no practical significance for data curation\\\"。唯一可挽救的角度是承认 \\\"lab-to-wild transfer is an open problem\\\" 并将其定位为 future work，但这进一步削弱了论文的 practical contribution claim。 建议：在 worst 档 reframe 下，此实验要么不做（节省 8 GPU-hours），要么放 Appendix 作为 honest limitation disclosure。\\n\\n\\nWorst 档下，lab→wild generalization gap 严重。(1) Common Crawl 文本的长度、格式、 语言混合度远超 C4 clean 子集，15D features 的分布发生显著偏移，导致 depth predictor calibration 崩溃（ECE=0.31）。(2) AlignScore 与 predicted depth 的相关性仅 ρ=-0.08 且不显著——审稿人解读为\\\"depth ≠ quality\\\"，K* boundary 对数据治理没有 actionable 意义。(3) Vocabulary richness 有微弱负相关（ρ=-0.14, p=0.002），但效应量太小 无法作为 validation 证据。(4) 42% 样本被预测为 depth 0（human），但 Common Crawl 中 AI-generated 内容估计已达 15-25%——模型严重低估合成文本比例，暴露 false negative 问题。(5) 审稿人攻击：训练在 clean C4 + 单一模型生成链上的 classifier 无法处理 wild 数据中 multiple unknown generators、mixed languages、post-editing 等复杂性。 整体结论：naturalistic validation 失败，反而成为审稿人攻击 ecological validity 的弹药。\\n\"\n94\t  },\n95\t  {\n96\t    \"name\": \"exp-028: Subsampling Power Curve\",\n97\t    \"description\": \"C4 n={1000,2000,3000,4000,5000} × 10 resamples，计算每个样本量下 1v2 AUC 的 bootstrap CI 和 K*=2 判定的成功率。确定 K*=2 所需最低样本量。\\n\",\n98\t    \"results\": {\n99\t      \"power_curve\": {\n100\t        \"n1000\": {\n101\t          \"mean_1v2_auc\": 0.6095,\n102\t          \"std_1v2_auc\": 0.028,\n103\t          \"ci_lower_mean\": 0.581,\n104\t          \"pct_kstar2\": 0.4,\n105\t          \"pct_kstar1\": 0.6\n106\t        },\n107\t        \"n2000\": {\n108\t          \"mean_1v2_auc\": 0.6108,\n109\t          \"std_1v2_auc\": 0.019,\n110\t          \"ci_lower_mean\": 0.592,\n111\t          \"pct_kstar2\": 0.5,\n112\t          \"pct_kstar1\": 0.5\n113\t        },\n114\t        \"n3000\": {\n115\t          \"mean_1v2_auc\": 0.6115,\n116\t          \"std_1v2_auc\": 0.015,\n117\t          \"ci_lower_mean\": 0.597,\n118\t          \"pct_kstar2\": 0.6,\n119\t          \"pct_kstar1\": 0.4\n120\t        },\n121\t        \"n4000\": {\n122\t          \"mean_1v2_auc\": 0.6118,\n123\t          \"std_1v2_auc\": 0.012,\n124\t          \"ci_lower_mean\": 0.6,\n125\t          \"pct_kstar2\": 0.8,\n126\t          \"pct_kstar1\": 0.2\n127\t        },\n128\t        \"n5000\": {\n129\t          \"mean_1v2_auc\": 0.612,\n130\t          \"std_1v2_auc\": 0.01,\n131\t          \"ci_lower_mean\": 0.602,\n132\t          \"pct_kstar2\": 0.9,\n133\t          \"pct_kstar1\": 0.1\n134\t        }\n135\t      },\n136\t      \"minimum_n_for_80pct_power\": 4000,\n137\t      \"minimum_n_for_90pct_power\": 5000,\n138\t      \"model_used\": \"Qwen-1.5B-Instruct continuation (most marginal, CI lower=0.6015)\",\n139\t      \"resamples_per_n\": 10,\n140\t      \"bootstrap_iterations\": 10000,\n141\t      \"theta\": 0.6,\n142\t      \"critical_observation\": \"K*=2 判定需要 n≥4000 才能在 80% 的 resamples 中成立。n=1000 时仅 40% 成功， 意味着如果原始实验只用了 1000 个样本，K*=2 的结论不可复现。\\n\"\n143\t    },\n144\t    \"tables\": [\n145\t      {\n146\t        \"name\": \"Table: K*=2 Detection Power by Sample Size (Qwen-cont, C4)\",\n147\t        \"columns\": [\n148\t          \"n per depth\",\n149\t          \"Mean 1v2 AUC\",\n150\t          \"SD\",\n151\t          \"Mean CI lower\",\n152\t          \"% K*=2\",\n153\t          \"% K*=1\"\n154\t        ],\n155\t        \"rows\": [\n156\t          [\n157\t            \"1,000\",\n158\t            \"0.6095\",\n159\t            \"0.028\",\n160\t            \"0.581\",\n161\t            \"40%\",\n162\t            \"60%\"\n163\t          ],\n164\t          [\n165\t            \"2,000\",\n166\t            \"0.6108\",\n167\t            \"0.019\",\n168\t            \"0.592\",\n169\t            \"50%\",\n170\t            \"50%\"\n171\t          ],\n172\t          [\n173\t            \"3,000\",\n174\t            \"0.6115\",\n175\t            \"0.015\",\n176\t            \"0.597\",\n177\t            \"60%\",\n178\t            \"40%\"\n179\t          ],\n180\t          [\n181\t            \"4,000\",\n182\t            \"0.6118\",\n183\t            \"0.012\",\n184\t            \"0.600\",\n185\t            \"80%\",\n186\t            \"20%\"\n187\t          ],\n188\t          [\n189\t            \"5,000\",\n190\t            \"0.6120\",\n191\t            \"0.010\",\n192\t            \"0.602\",\n193\t            \"90%\",\n194\t            \"10%\"\n195\t          ]\n196\t        ]\n197\t      },\n198\t      {\n199\t        \"name\": \"Table: Power Comparison Across Models at n=3000\",\n200\t        \"columns\": [\n201\t          \"Model\",\n202\t          \"1v2 AUC (full)\",\n203\t          \"Margin over θ\",\n204\t          \"Est. % K*=2 at n=3000\"\n205\t        ],\n206\t        \"rows\": [\n207\t          [\n208\t            \"Pythia-1.4B\",\n209\t            \"0.6539\",\n210\t            \"+5.39pp\",\n211\t            \"95%\"\n212\t          ],\n213\t          [\n214\t            \"OLMo-1B\",\n215\t            \"0.6145\",\n216\t            \"+1.45pp\",\n217\t            \"65%\"\n218\t          ],\n219\t          [\n220\t            \"Qwen-cont\",\n221\t            \"0.6112\",\n222\t            \"+1.12pp\",\n223\t            \"60%\"\n224\t          ],\n225\t          [\n226\t            \"LLaMA-8B\",\n227\t            \"0.6123\",\n228\t            \"+1.23pp\",\n229\t            \"62%\"\n230\t          ],\n231\t          [\n232\t            \"Qwen-base\",\n233\t            \"0.6262\",\n234\t            \"+2.62pp\",\n235\t            \"80%\"\n236\t          ],\n237\t          [\n238\t            \"Qwen-7B\",\n239\t            \"0.6178\",\n240\t            \"+1.78pp\",\n241\t            \"70%\"\n242\t          ],\n243\t          [\n244\t            \"Mistral-7B\",\n245\t            \"0.5935\",\n246\t            \"-0.65pp\",\n247\t            \"5%\"\n248\t          ]\n249\t        ]\n250\t      }\n251\t    ],\n252\t    \"figures\": [],\n253\t    \"analysis\": \"在 worst 档下，exp-028 是双刃剑。表面上它回应了 reviewer concern（\\\"我们的 n=5000 提供了充分的 statistical power\\\"），但更深层地暴露了两个致命问题：\\n(1) Signal weakness：K*=2 on C4 的 effect size（Cohen's h≈0.20-0.22）处于 \\\"small effect\\\" 的最低端。需要 4000-5000 样本才能可靠检测，审稿人将此与 K*∈{1,2,3} 的 \\\"trivial observation\\\" 攻击结合——\\\"你需要精密的统计工具才能看到一个所有人直觉上 就知道的事情（recursive generation degrades fast）\\\"。\\n(2) Differential power across models：Pythia（+5.39pp margin）在 n=1000 就能 稳定 K*=2，但 Qwen-cont（+1.12pp）和 LLaMA-8B（+1.23pp）需要 n≥4000。这意味着 \\\"7/8 configs K*=2\\\" 的 claim 实际上有模型依赖的 power asymmetry。如果审稿人指出 \\\"3/8 models only marginally pass the threshold at your chosen sample size\\\"， K*=2 作为 robust finding 的叙事进一步削弱。\\n对 worst 档 reframe 的贡献：power curve 数据可以支持 continuous decay rate framing——不同模型在 θ=0.60 附近的 AUC 差异反映的是 decay rate 的连续变化， 而非 K* 作为 discrete boundary 的跳变。这与 \\\"lossy channel\\\" reframe 一致。 建议放在 Appendix 作为 statistical rigor 证据，但主文不应强调 power analysis 的具体数字，以免引导审稿人注意到 marginal configurations 的 power 不足。\\n\\nWorst 档下，power curve 暴露了 K*=2 判定的脆弱性。核心问题：(1) Qwen-cont 的 1v2 AUC=0.6112 仅比 θ=0.60 高 1.12pp。这个 tiny effect size 意味着需要大量样本 才能稳定检测。(2) n=1000 时 40% K*=2 / 60% K*=1——审稿人攻击：\\\"K* depends on sample size, not just on the data generating process\\\"。(3) n=4000 才达到 80% power——审稿人攻击：\\\"you need 4000 samples per depth pair to detect a signal that you claim is a fundamental property of recursive generation? This suggests the signal is vanishingly weak\\\"。(4) 更致命的是，如果审稿人将此与 θ-sensitivity 结合：θ=0.55 下 K*=2-3 everywhere（power curve 右移，更容易达到），θ=0.65 下 K*=1-2 everywhere（power curve 左移，更难达到）。K* 同时依赖 θ 和 n，审稿人 结论：\\\"K* is not a property of the data, but of your experimental design choices\\\"。 (5) 对比 arXiv（2v3 AUC=0.6427, +4.27pp above θ），预期 n=1000 即可 80% power， 强化了\\\"C4 上 K*=2 是边缘结果\\\"的叙事。(6) 唯一正面角度：n=5000 下 90% power 证明我们的实验设计是 adequate，但审稿人反驳：\\\"adequate power to detect a trivially small effect is not a defense of the effect's importance\\\"。\\n\"\n254\t  }\n255\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"46d8fabe-afed-4160-b848-9187ce37ba39","uuid":"af211fb6-bd27-407a-ad85-781514769641","timestamp":"2026-05-18T12:52:59.016Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_7/projects/gen-depth-contamination/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260518T123349/worst/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-014: Naturalistic Common Crawl Validation\",\n    \"description\": \"对 Common Crawl 2025/2026 snapshot 样本做 depth 预测，与 AlignScore 和独立 vocabulary richness 指标做 correlation。验证 lab 条件下训练的 depth estimator 在 wild 数据上的可迁移性。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"depth_pred_distribution\": {\n        \"pred_depth_0_pct\": 0.42,\n        \"pred_depth_1_pct\": 0.31,\n        \"pred_depth_2_pct\": 0.18,\n        \"pred_depth_3plus_pct\": 0.09\n      },\n      \"spearman_rho_depth_vs_alignscore\": -0.08,\n      \"spearman_rho_depth_vs_alignscore_p\": 0.07,\n      \"spearman_rho_depth_vs_vocab_richness\": -0.14,\n      \"spearman_rho_depth_vs_vocab_richness_p\": 0.002,\n      \"spearman_rho_depth_vs_perplexity\": 0.05,\n      \"spearman_rho_depth_vs_perplexity_p\": 0.28,\n      \"calibration_ece\": 0.31,\n      \"pred_confidence_mean\": 0.38,\n      \"pred_confidence_std\": 0.12,\n      \"domain_shift_auc_drop_vs_lab\": 0.15,\n      \"n_samples\": 10000,\n      \"cc_snapshot\": \"2025-51\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: CC 2025 Depth Prediction vs Quality Metrics\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Metric Pair\",\n          \"Spearman ρ\",\n          \"p-value\",\n          \"95% CI\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Pred Depth × AlignScore\",\n            \"-0.08\",\n            \"0.07\",\n            \"[-0.16, 0.01]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Pred Depth × Vocab Richness (TTR)\",\n            \"-0.14\",\n            \"0.002\",\n            \"[-0.22, -0.05]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Pred Depth × Perplexity (GPT-2)\",\n            \"0.05\",\n            \"0.28\",\n            \"[-0.04, 0.13]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Pred Depth × Doc Length\",\n            \"0.03\",\n            \"0.51\",\n            \"[-0.06, 0.11]\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Predicted Depth Distribution on CC vs Lab\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Depth\",\n          \"CC 2025 (%)\",\n          \"Lab C4 (%)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"0 (human)\",\n            \"42%\",\n            \"16.7%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"1\",\n            \"31%\",\n            \"16.7%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"2\",\n            \"18%\",\n            \"16.7%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"3+\",\n            \"9%\",\n            \"50.0%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"此实验在 worst 档下是 net negative。审稿人将用它构建两条攻击线：(1) \\\"the depth estimator doesn't generalize beyond the controlled lab setting — the features are overfit to the specific generation pipeline\\\" (2) \\\"even weak correlation with quality metrics is absent — K* boundary has no practical significance for data curation\\\"。唯一可挽救的角度是承认 \\\"lab-to-wild transfer is an open problem\\\" 并将其定位为 future work，但这进一步削弱了论文的 practical contribution claim。 建议：在 worst 档 reframe 下，此实验要么不做（节省 8 GPU-hours），要么放 Appendix 作为 honest limitation disclosure。\\n\\n\\nWorst 档下，lab→wild generalization gap 严重。(1) Common Crawl 文本的长度、格式、 语言混合度远超 C4 clean 子集，15D features 的分布发生显著偏移，导致 depth predictor calibration 崩溃（ECE=0.31）。(2) AlignScore 与 predicted depth 的相关性仅 ρ=-0.08 且不显著——审稿人解读为\\\"depth ≠ quality\\\"，K* boundary 对数据治理没有 actionable 意义。(3) Vocabulary richness 有微弱负相关（ρ=-0.14, p=0.002），但效应量太小 无法作为 validation 证据。(4) 42% 样本被预测为 depth 0（human），但 Common Crawl 中 AI-generated 内容估计已达 15-25%——模型严重低估合成文本比例，暴露 false negative 问题。(5) 审稿人攻击：训练在 clean C4 + 单一模型生成链上的 classifier 无法处理 wild 数据中 multiple unknown generators、mixed languages、post-editing 等复杂性。 整体结论：naturalistic validation 失败，反而成为审稿人攻击 ecological validity 的弹药。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exp-028: Subsampling Power Curve\",\n    \"description\": \"C4 n={1000,2000,3000,4000,5000} × 10 resamples，计算每个样本量下 1v2 AUC 的 bootstrap CI 和 K*=2 判定的成功率。确定 K*=2 所需最低样本量。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"power_curve\": {\n        \"n1000\": {\n          \"mean_1v2_auc\": 0.6095,\n          \"std_1v2_auc\": 0.028,\n          \"ci_lower_mean\": 0.581,\n          \"pct_kstar2\": 0.4,\n          \"pct_kstar1\": 0.6\n        },\n        \"n2000\": {\n          \"mean_1v2_auc\": 0.6108,\n          \"std_1v2_auc\": 0.019,\n          \"ci_lower_mean\": 0.592,\n          \"pct_kstar2\": 0.5,\n          \"pct_kstar1\": 0.5\n        },\n        \"n3000\": {\n          \"mean_1v2_auc\": 0.6115,\n          \"std_1v2_auc\": 0.015,\n          \"ci_lower_mean\": 0.597,\n          \"pct_kstar2\": 0.6,\n          \"pct_kstar1\": 0.4\n        },\n        \"n4000\": {\n          \"mean_1v2_auc\": 0.6118,\n          \"std_1v2_auc\": 0.012,\n          \"ci_lower_mean\": 0.6,\n          \"pct_kstar2\": 0.8,\n          \"pct_kstar1\": 0.2\n        },\n        \"n5000\": {\n          \"mean_1v2_auc\": 0.612,\n          \"std_1v2_auc\": 0.01,\n          \"ci_lower_mean\": 0.602,\n          \"pct_kstar2\": 0.9,\n          \"pct_kstar1\": 0.1\n        }\n      },\n      \"minimum_n_for_80pct_power\": 4000,\n      \"minimum_n_for_90pct_power\": 5000,\n      \"model_used\": \"Qwen-1.5B-Instruct continuation (most marginal, CI lower=0.6015)\",\n      \"resamples_per_n\": 10,\n      \"bootstrap_iterations\": 10000,\n      \"theta\": 0.6,\n      \"critical_observation\": \"K*=2 判定需要 n≥4000 才能在 80% 的 resamples 中成立。n=1000 时仅 40% 成功， 意味着如果原始实验只用了 1000 个样本，K*=2 的结论不可复现。\\n\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: K*=2 Detection Power by Sample Size (Qwen-cont, C4)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"n per depth\",\n          \"Mean 1v2 AUC\",\n          \"SD\",\n          \"Mean CI lower\",\n          \"% K*=2\",\n          \"% K*=1\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"1,000\",\n            \"0.6095\",\n            \"0.028\",\n            \"0.581\",\n            \"40%\",\n            \"60%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"2,000\",\n            \"0.6108\",\n            \"0.019\",\n            \"0.592\",\n            \"50%\",\n            \"50%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"3,000\",\n            \"0.6115\",\n            \"0.015\",\n            \"0.597\",\n            \"60%\",\n            \"40%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"4,000\",\n            \"0.6118\",\n            \"0.012\",\n            \"0.600\",\n            \"80%\",\n            \"20%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"5,000\",\n            \"0.6120\",\n            \"0.010\",\n            \"0.602\",\n            \"90%\",\n            \"10%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Power Comparison Across Models at n=3000\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"1v2 AUC (full)\",\n          \"Margin over θ\",\n          \"Est. % K*=2 at n=3000\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Pythia-1.4B\",\n            \"0.6539\",\n            \"+5.39pp\",\n            \"95%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"OLMo-1B\",\n            \"0.6145\",\n            \"+1.45pp\",\n            \"65%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen-cont\",\n            \"0.6112\",\n            \"+1.12pp\",\n            \"60%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"LLaMA-8B\",\n            \"0.6123\",\n            \"+1.23pp\",\n            \"62%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen-base\",\n            \"0.6262\",\n            \"+2.62pp\",\n            \"80%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen-7B\",\n            \"0.6178\",\n            \"+1.78pp\",\n            \"70%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Mistral-7B\",\n            \"0.5935\",\n            \"-0.65pp\",\n            \"5%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"在 worst 档下，exp-028 是双刃剑。表面上它回应了 reviewer concern（\\\"我们的 n=5000 提供了充分的 statistical power\\\"），但更深层地暴露了两个致命问题：\\n(1) Signal weakness：K*=2 on C4 的 effect size（Cohen's h≈0.20-0.22）处于 \\\"small effect\\\" 的最低端。需要 4000-5000 样本才能可靠检测，审稿人将此与 K*∈{1,2,3} 的 \\\"trivial observation\\\" 攻击结合——\\\"你需要精密的统计工具才能看到一个所有人直觉上 就知道的事情（recursive generation degrades fast）\\\"。\\n(2) Differential power across models：Pythia（+5.39pp margin）在 n=1000 就能 稳定 K*=2，但 Qwen-cont（+1.12pp）和 LLaMA-8B（+1.23pp）需要 n≥4000。这意味着 \\\"7/8 configs K*=2\\\" 的 claim 实际上有模型依赖的 power asymmetry。如果审稿人指出 \\\"3/8 models only marginally pass the threshold at your chosen sample size\\\"， K*=2 作为 robust finding 的叙事进一步削弱。\\n对 worst 档 reframe 的贡献：power curve 数据可以支持 continuous decay rate framing——不同模型在 θ=0.60 附近的 AUC 差异反映的是 decay rate 的连续变化， 而非 K* 作为 discrete boundary 的跳变。这与 \\\"lossy channel\\\" reframe 一致。 建议放在 Appendix 作为 statistical rigor 证据，但主文不应强调 power analysis 的具体数字，以免引导审稿人注意到 marginal configurations 的 power 不足。\\n\\nWorst 档下，power curve 暴露了 K*=2 判定的脆弱性。核心问题：(1) Qwen-cont 的 1v2 AUC=0.6112 仅比 θ=0.60 高 1.12pp。这个 tiny effect size 意味着需要大量样本 才能稳定检测。(2) n=1000 时 40% K*=2 / 60% K*=1——审稿人攻击：\\\"K* depends on sample size, not just on the data generating process\\\"。(3) n=4000 才达到 80% power——审稿人攻击：\\\"you need 4000 samples per depth pair to detect a signal that you claim is a fundamental property of recursive generation? This suggests the signal is vanishingly weak\\\"。(4) 更致命的是，如果审稿人将此与 θ-sensitivity 结合：θ=0.55 下 K*=2-3 everywhere（power curve 右移，更容易达到），θ=0.65 下 K*=1-2 everywhere（power curve 左移，更难达到）。K* 同时依赖 θ 和 n，审稿人 结论：\\\"K* is not a property of the data, but of your experimental design choices\\\"。 (5) 对比 arXiv（2v3 AUC=0.6427, +4.27pp above θ），预期 n=1000 即可 80% power， 强化了\\\"C4 上 K*=2 是边缘结果\\\"的叙事。(6) 唯一正面角度：n=5000 下 90% power 证明我们的实验设计是 adequate，但审稿人反驳：\\\"adequate power to detect a trivially small effect is not a defense of the effect's importance\\\"。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":255,"startLine":1,"totalLines":255}}}
